    "detailed_description": "<h1>NYX Award Winner!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/95e470ba0d8fc7c1a022991182aba974.poster.avif?t=1740990707\" width=100 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/95e470ba0d8fc7c1a022991182aba974.webm?t=1740990707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/44179b89053733d1d6182f6702a607ec.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the embodiment of the last thought of hope to enter a suicidal mind!<br><br> battling your inner demons and corrupted thoughts to reclaim what ever is left of a shattered psyche in modern Rogue lite setting, over 50 weapons, passive abilities, skill trees and all the goodness you would expect of a Rogue title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/cf25e3f9178e4825ac0fec73dbfb8a94.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/0d832c3a32c58b1665f46646c59c7953.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAGIC BASED FPS ACTION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of powerful spells that represent internal emotions ranging from Passion, Rage, Fear, and Fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/368dc46520f20435d95ae2811d2cbc51.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AWESOME FINISHERS </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a cool demon slaying FPS without brutal finishers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blended the magical move sets with our beloved wrestling inspired moves to finish your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE 5 KINGDOMS AND WHAT'S IN BETWEEN </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last thought of hope, it'll be your task to restore balance to this twisted mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will journey as a single thought, born in the Panic Pit all the way to the 5 kingdoms that make up your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/5ceb1df25a879f1408e2a1dbf2365ca4.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARK AND GOTHIC AESTHETIC </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic and medieval theme prevails in the world design, filled with magic, whimsical creatures and dragons! You've got to have dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/09c94a1d56105ad66bcd4f3c255cd5c3.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSYCHOLOGICALLY INSPIRED STORY </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/db28db9a98d055410fb461f9cda01f18.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore emotions, feelings and thoughts, visualized into characters, friends and foes!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the aim of improving your mental health awareness through storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/44179b89053733d1d6182f6702a607ec.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the embodiment of the last thought of hope to enter a suicidal mind!<br><br> battling your inner demons and corrupted thoughts to reclaim what ever is left of a shattered psyche in modern Rogue lite setting, over 50 weapons, passive abilities, skill trees and all the goodness you would expect of a Rogue title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/cf25e3f9178e4825ac0fec73dbfb8a94.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/0d832c3a32c58b1665f46646c59c7953.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAGIC BASED FPS ACTION</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of powerful spells that represent internal emotions ranging from Passion, Rage, Fear, and Fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/368dc46520f20435d95ae2811d2cbc51.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AWESOME FINISHERS </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a cool demon slaying FPS without brutal finishers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blended the magical move sets with our beloved wrestling inspired moves to finish your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE 5 KINGDOMS AND WHAT'S IN BETWEEN </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last thought of hope, it'll be your task to restore balance to this twisted mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will journey as a single thought, born in the Panic Pit all the way to the 5 kingdoms that make up your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/5ceb1df25a879f1408e2a1dbf2365ca4.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARK AND GOTHIC AESTHETIC </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic and medieval theme prevails in the world design, filled with magic, whimsical creatures and dragons! You've got to have dragons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/09c94a1d56105ad66bcd4f3c255cd5c3.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSYCHOLOGICALLY INSPIRED STORY </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443900/extras/db28db9a98d055410fb461f9cda01f18.avif?t=1740990707\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore emotions, feelings and thoughts, visualized into characters, friends and foes!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the aim of improving your mental health awareness through storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
